<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Location Power Differential Mapping · Strategy Command Center</title>

<style>
:root{
    /* BROWN · BLUE · CREAM */
    --brown-deep:#3E2723;
    --brown:#5D4037;
    --brown-soft:#8D6E63;
    --blue-deep:#0D1B2A;
    --blue:#1B3A4B;
    --blue-mid:#2C5F7C;
    --blue-soft:#4A7C9B;
    --cream:#F5EDE3;
    --cream-soft:#E8DDD0;
    --cream-dim:#CBBEB0;
    --gold:#D8B08C;

    --bg:var(--brown-deep);
    --surface:var(--brown);
    --surface2:#6D4C41;
    --panel:var(--blue);
    --panel-deep:var(--blue-deep);
    --text:var(--cream);
    --muted:var(--cream-dim);
    --border:rgba(216,176,140,.28);
    --border-strong:rgba(216,176,140,.55);

    --accent:var(--gold);
    --accent-blue:var(--blue-soft);
    --success:#8FBC9A;
    --warning:#E8C98B;
    --danger:#D99090;

    --shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
}

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

body{
    font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.7;
}

button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;}
button{cursor:pointer;}

button:focus-visible,
input:focus-visible,
select:focus-visible,
textarea:focus-visible,
a:focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset:3px;
}

a{color:var(--gold);}

/* =========================
   SCROLL PROGRESS
========================= */
#scrollProgress{
    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:4px;width:0%;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--accent-blue));
    z-index:9999;
}

/* =========================
   NAV
========================= */
.nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1000;
    background:rgba(62,39,35,.94);
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.nav-inner{
    max-width:1250px;margin:auto;min-height:64px;
    padding:10px 20px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;
}
.brand{
    color:var(--gold);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.8rem;
}
.nav-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}

.nav-btn,.btn{
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    background:var(--panel);
    color:var(--text);
    padding:9px 14px;border-radius:9px;
    transition:.2s ease;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;
}
.nav-btn:hover,.btn:hover{
    border-color:var(--accent);
    color:var(--accent);
    transform:translateY(-1px);
}
.btn.primary{
    background:var(--accent);
    color:var(--brown-deep);
    border-color:var(--accent);
    font-weight:800;
}
.btn.primary:hover{
    background:#E7C9A0;
    color:var(--brown-deep);
}
.btn.ghost{
    background:transparent;
    border-color:var(--border-strong);
}

/* =========================
   HERO
========================= */
.hero{
    min-height:640px;
    display:grid;place-items:center;
    padding:80px 20px 70px;
    position:relative;overflow:hidden;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 20%,rgba(74,124,155,.22),transparent 32%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 72%,rgba(216,176,140,.14),transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(150deg,var(--blue-deep),var(--brown-deep) 70%,var(--brown));
}
.hero-grid{
    width:100%;max-width:1250px;
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
    gap:60px;align-items:center;
}
.eyebrow{
    color:var(--gold);text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;
    margin-bottom:18px;
}
.hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,5.8rem);
    line-height:.98;max-width:850px;letter-spacing:-.055em;
}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--gold);}
.hero-copy{
    max-width:760px;color:var(--cream-dim);
    font-size:1.08rem;margin-top:25px;
}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px;}

/* =========================
   PLAYER CARD
========================= */
.player-card{
    background:linear-gradient(155deg,var(--panel),var(--panel-deep));
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:24px;padding:26px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.player-top{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px;
}
.rank{
    color:var(--gold);font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:.8rem;
}
.xp-number{font-size:2rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--cream);}
.xp-label{color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;}
.xp-track{
    height:10px;background:rgba(13,27,42,.8);
    border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0 20px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
}
.xp-fill{
    height:100%;width:0%;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--accent-blue));
    transition:.5s ease;
}
.stat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;}
.stat{
    padding:15px;background:rgba(13,27,42,.55);
    border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;
}
.stat small{
    display:block;color:var(--muted);
    text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.1em;
}
.stat strong{display:block;margin-top:3px;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.15rem;}

/* =========================
   MAIN
========================= */
.container{width:min(1250px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto;}
section{padding:80px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}

.section-head{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:end;gap:25px;margin-bottom:35px;
}
.section-number{
    color:var(--gold);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.18em;
}
h2{
    font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);
    line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-top:8px;
}
.section-intro{max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);}

/* =========================
   QUOTE
========================= */
.quote{
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    background:
        linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(74,124,155,.18),rgba(216,176,140,.08)),
        var(--panel);
    border-radius:22px;padding:40px;
    font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.5;
    text-align:center;font-weight:700;
}
.quote span{color:var(--gold);}

/* =========================
   INSIGHT CARDS
========================= */
.insight-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;
}
.insight-card{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:28px;border-radius:18px;
    position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:.25s ease;
}
.insight-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:var(--accent);}
.insight-card .number{
    color:var(--gold);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.15em;
}
.insight-card h3{margin:13px 0 10px;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--gold);}
.insight-card p{color:var(--muted);}
.reveal{
    max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;transition:.35s ease;
    color:var(--cream-soft);font-size:.95rem;
}
.insight-card.open .reveal{max-height:300px;opacity:1;margin-top:18px;}
.reveal-btn{
    margin-top:18px;background:none;color:var(--gold);
    border:0;font-weight:800;padding:0;
}

/* =========================
   LOCATION LAB
========================= */
.lab{
    background:
        linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(74,124,155,.15),transparent 40%),
        var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:24px;padding:30px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.lab-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px;}
.form-group{margin-bottom:20px;}
.form-group label{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom:8px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:800;
    color:var(--cream);
}
.value-display{color:var(--gold);}

input[type="text"],
input[type="number"],
select,
textarea{
    width:100%;
    background:var(--blue-deep);
    color:var(--text);
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:10px;padding:13px 14px;
}
input[type="range"]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--gold);}
.range-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 65px;gap:12px;align-items:center;}

.score-panel{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    flex-direction:column;min-height:100%;
    background:var(--blue-deep);
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:18px;padding:30px;text-align:center;
}
.score-ring{
    width:180px;height:180px;border-radius:50%;
    display:grid;place-items:center;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle,var(--blue-deep) 58%,transparent 59%),
        conic-gradient(var(--gold) 0deg,#2C3E4A 0deg);
    transition:.4s ease;
}
.score-ring strong{font-size:3rem;color:var(--cream);}
.score-status{margin-top:15px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:900;}
.score-explanation{max-width:420px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;}

/* =========================
   MATRIX
========================= */
.matrix{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;}
.matrix-item{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;padding:22px;
}
.matrix-item h3{color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;}
.matrix-item p{color:var(--muted);}

/* =========================
   SCENARIO SIMULATOR
========================= */
.simulator{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--panel);
}
.scenario-menu{background:var(--blue-deep);border-right:1px solid var(--border);}
.scenario-btn{
    width:100%;padding:18px;background:transparent;color:var(--text);
    border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);text-align:left;
}
.scenario-btn:hover,.scenario-btn.active{
    background:var(--panel);color:var(--gold);
}
.scenario-content{padding:35px;}
.scenario-panel{display:none;}
.scenario-panel.active{display:block;}
.scenario-panel h3{color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px;}
.scenario-panel p{color:var(--cream-soft);}
.scenario-metric{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:12px;margin-top:25px;
}
.metric{
    background:var(--blue-deep);padding:17px;border-radius:12px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
}
.metric span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;text-transform:uppercase;}
.metric strong{color:var(--gold);font-size:1.25rem;}

/* =========================
   AUDIT
========================= */
.audit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:25px;}
.audit-list{display:grid;gap:10px;}
.audit-item{
    display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:17px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;
}
.audit-item input{margin-top:6px;accent-color:var(--gold);}
.audit-item.completed{border-color:var(--success);opacity:.8;}
.audit-item.completed span{text-decoration:line-through;}
.audit-score{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:18px;padding:25px;height:max-content;
    position:sticky;top:90px;
}
.audit-score-number{font-size:3rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);}

/* =========================
   STRATEGY BUILDER
========================= */
.builder{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:22px;padding:30px;
}
.builder-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;}
.builder-output{
    background:var(--blue-deep);border:1px dashed var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:15px;padding:22px;min-height:280px;
}
.output-label{
    color:var(--gold);font-size:.7rem;text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:15px;
}
.output-line{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0;
}
.output-line span{color:var(--muted);}
.output-line strong{text-align:right;max-width:60%;word-break:break-word;}

/* =========================
   PROGRESSION
========================= */
.progression{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:10px;}
.level{
    border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--panel);
    border-radius:15px;padding:20px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;
}
.level:hover,.level.active{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--blue-mid);}
.level-number{color:var(--gold);font-weight:900;}
.level h3{margin:8px 0;font-size:1rem;color:var(--cream);}
.level p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;}
.level-detail{
    margin-top:18px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:15px;padding:22px;min-height:100px;color:var(--cream-soft);
}

/* =========================
   MISSIONS
========================= */
.mission-board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px;}
.mission{
    border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--panel);
    border-radius:15px;padding:22px;
}
.mission.done{border-color:var(--success);background:var(--blue-mid);}
.mission h3{margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--gold);}
.mission p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;}
.xp-tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:15px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:900;}

/* =========================
   OPPORTUNITY SEARCH
========================= */
.search-panel{
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--panel),var(--blue-deep));
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:18px;padding:clamp(20px,4vw,36px);
}
.search-panel > p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:24px;}
.search-form{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;
}
.field{min-width:0;}
.field label{
    display:block;font-weight:bold;color:var(--cream);margin-bottom:7px;
    font-size:.85rem;
}
.field input,.field select{
    width:100%;min-height:48px;padding:11px 12px;
    background:var(--blue-deep);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:7px;color:var(--cream);
}
.field select option{background:var(--blue-deep);}
.field.full{grid-column:1 / -1;}
.search-button{
    border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:13px 19px;
    font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;min-height:48px;
    background:var(--gold);color:var(--brown-deep);width:100%;
    transition:.2s;
}
.search-button:hover{background:var(--cream);}
.search-note{margin-top:13px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;}

.results{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:24px;}
.results h3{margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--gold);}
.results-summary{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px;}
.search-results-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,230px),1fr));
    gap:13px;
}
.search-result{
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;
    gap:9px;padding:18px;background:var(--blue-deep);
    border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;
}
.search-result h4{color:var(--gold);font-size:1.02rem;}
.search-result p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;flex:1;}
.search-result a{
    display:inline-block;padding:8px 0;font-weight:bold;
    text-decoration:underline;color:var(--gold);
}

.quick-categories{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:22px;}
.quick-categories button{
    background:transparent;color:var(--cream);
    border:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 13px;
    border-radius:24px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;
}
.quick-categories button:hover{
    background:var(--brown);border-color:var(--gold);
}

/* =========================
   TRIAD / FACTS
========================= */
.triad-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;}
.triad-card{
    background:var(--panel);padding:23px;border-radius:12px;
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
}
.triad-card h3{color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:12px;font-size:1.2rem;}
.triad-card ul{padding-left:19px;margin-top:10px;}
.triad-card li{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:7px;}

/* =========================
   TABLE
========================= */
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--border);}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.94rem;margin:0;}
th{background:var(--brown);text-align:left;color:var(--cream);padding:13px;}
th,td{padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:top;}
td{color:var(--cream-soft);}
tr:nth-child(even){background:var(--panel);}
tr:nth-child(odd){background:var(--blue-deep);}

/* =========================
   CHECKLIST / CALLOUT
========================= */
.checklist{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    padding:25px;border-radius:12px;
}
.checklist ul{padding-left:22px;}
.checklist li{margin:9px 0;color:var(--cream-soft);}

.callout{
    border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:15px 18px;
    background:rgba(27,58,75,.7);margin-top:18px;
    border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;color:var(--cream-soft);
}

/* =========================
   FOOTER
========================= */
footer{
    padding:80px 20px;text-align:center;
    background:var(--blue-deep);
    border-top:1px solid var(--border-strong);
}
footer h2{color:var(--gold);max-width:750px;margin:auto;border:none;padding:0;}
footer p{color:var(--muted);max-width:750px;margin:18px auto 0;}

/* =========================
   TOAST
========================= */
#toast{
    position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;
    background:var(--gold);color:var(--brown-deep);
    padding:13px 17px;border-radius:10px;
    font-weight:800;transform:translateY(100px);
    opacity:0;transition:.3s;z-index:9999;
    max-width:320px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
#toast.show{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1;}

/* =========================
   RESPONSIVE
========================= */
@media(max-width:1000px){
    .triad-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
}
@media(max-width:900px){
    .hero-grid,.lab-grid,.audit,.builder-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .insight-grid,.mission-board{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .progression{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .simulator{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .scenario-menu{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
    .search-form{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .field.full{grid-column:auto;}
}
@media(max-width:650px){
    .nav-inner{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;}
    .hero{padding-top:55px;}
    .hero h1{font-size:2.7rem;}
    .insight-grid,.matrix,.mission-board,.scenario-metric,.progression{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .section-head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;}
    .lab,.builder{padding:20px;}
    .quote{padding:25px;font-size:1.08rem;}
    .hero h1{font-size:2.2rem;}
    th,td{padding:9px;min-width:120px;}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div id="scrollProgress"></div>

<!-- =========================
     NAVIGATION
========================= -->
<nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
        <div class="brand">Location Power · Strategy Lab</div>
        <div class="nav-actions">
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('locationLab')">Location Lab</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('opportunitySearch')">Opportunities</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('audit')">Audit</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('missions')">Missions</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="resetProgress()">Reset</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>


<!-- =========================
     HERO
========================= -->
<header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Strategic Mobility &amp; Opportunity Intelligence</div>
            <h1>
                Location Is a
                <span>Variable.</span>
                Treat It Like One.
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">
                Location Power Differential Mapping transforms geography from a passive backdrop
                into a decision variable. Instead of asking only where you want to live or work,
                evaluate where your particular combination of capabilities, demand, competition,
                infrastructure, purchasing power, and networks produces the strongest strategic position.
                Identify geographic zones where your specialized competencies scale disproportionately,
                maximize value capture, and escape hyper-competitive local ceilings.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <button class="btn primary" onclick="scrollToSection('locationLab')">Run Location Analysis</button>
                <button class="btn ghost" onclick="scrollToSection('opportunitySearch')">Search Opportunities</button>
                <button class="btn ghost" onclick="scrollToSection('missions')">Start Missions</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="player-card">
            <div class="player-top">
                <div>
                    <div class="rank" id="rankName">STRATEGIST I</div>
                    <div class="xp-label">Strategic XP</div>
                </div>
                <div class="xp-number" id="xpNumber">0</div>
            </div>
            <div class="xp-track"><div class="xp-fill" id="xpFill"></div></div>
            <div class="stat-grid">
                <div class="stat"><small>Location Score</small><strong id="heroScore">50</strong></div>
                <div class="stat"><small>Audit</small><strong id="heroAudit">0%</strong></div>
                <div class="stat"><small>Missions</small><strong id="heroMissions">0/6</strong></div>
                <div class="stat"><small>Level</small><strong id="heroLevel">01</strong></div>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </div>
</header>


<main class="container">

<!-- =========================
     CORE CONCEPT
========================= -->
<section>
    <div class="section-head">
        <div>
            <div class="section-number">01 / THE MODEL</div>
            <h2>Move From Geography to Strategy</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-intro">
            The central question is not whether one location is universally better than another.
            It is whether a particular environment improves the economics of your specific situation.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="quote">
        A location becomes strategically powerful when it improves the relationship between
        <span>what you can produce</span>, <span>who needs it</span>, and
        <span>what it costs to remain positioned there.</span>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:22px;color:var(--cream-soft);max-width:900px;">
        Location Power Differential Mapping is a strategic intelligence methodology used to evaluate how
        different economic, geographical, and digital ecosystems alter the net return on invested human capital.
        By examining spatial asymmetries, you can identify nodes where your specific asset mix is critically scarce.
        Instead of attempting to out-compete hyper-dense incumbents in saturated native markets, this paradigm
        shifts focus toward structural arbitrage—placing your abilities into high-leverage environments where the
        cost of competition is low and the marginal utility of your output is maximized.
    </p>
</section>


