                <p class="score-explanation" id="scoreExplanation">
                    Your current assumptions produce a balanced strategic position. Increase the variables
                    that create leverage rather than optimizing one category in isolation.
                </p>
                <button class="btn primary" style="margin-top:20px" onclick="saveLocationAnalysis()">Save Analysis</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


